    "done_when": "In imas_ambix/maps_cli.py, a release whose push raises leaves the local bundle.json version field exactly as it was before the call; a test in tests/test_maps_cli.py makes the stubbed registry push raise and asserts the field is unchanged afterwards. The tree-digest annotation test compares against an expected digest that is not recomputed by tree_digest on the same directory, for example a value fixed for the fixture tree. The no-git-tag test fails if release invokes any git tag command, for example by recording subprocess calls in the stub. All tests use the stubbed registry and make no network call. tests/test_maps_cli.py runs whole at base and head, each captured to a log ending in the pytest summary and an EXIT line, and adds no failure. uv run --no-sync ruff check imas_ambix tests packages exits 0.",
